    "\n",
    "The process is divided into two steps:\n",
    "\n",
    "1. Extract course titles and descriptions to create clear, in-depth summaries of each Mechanical Engineering course.\n",
    "\n",
    "2. Generate example questions or topics a student may encounter, based on the course content.\n",
    "\n",
    "Separating these steps ensures higher-quality, context-aware outputs for both descriptions and question generation.\n"
   ]
