    "# Testing functioanlity first\n",
    "class AdditionalCourseDescription(BaseModel):\n",
    "    questions: str = Field(\"A set of questions in bullet point format\")\n",
    "    topics: str = Field(\n",
    "        \"A set of topics that the course covers with a consise descritions\"\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    \n",
    "\n",
    "courses = response\n",
    "vals = [0, 10, 30, 50]\n",
    "for val in vals:\n",
    "    course = courses.choices[0].message.parsed.courses[val]\n",
    "\n",
    "    prompt = f\"\"\"\n",
    "    You are given the description of a Mechanical Engineering course along with its course level.\n",
    "\n",
    "    Your task is to analyze the description and generate the following:\n",
    "\n",
    "    ## Key Topics\n",
    "    - Provide a bullet-point list of the main topics, core concepts, and subject areas the course is expected to cover.\n",
    "    - Ensure the topics reflect the depth and scope appropriate to the course level.\n",
    "\n",
    "    ## Example Questions\n",
    "    - Provide 1–3 example questions or problems that a student should be able to solve by the end of the course.\n",
    "    - These may take the form of:\n",
    "      - Computational problems\n",
    "      - Multiple-choice questions\n",
    "      - Lab-based tasks\n",
    "      - Project-based challenges\n",
    "    - The questions should reflect the course’s overall scope and difficulty and represent what a student might encounter in exams, assignments, or projects.\n",
    "    - Ensure coverage across a range of the listed key topics.\n",
    "\n",
    "    ## Course Level Guidelines\n",
    "    Take into account the level of the course when generating topics and questions:\n",
    "    - **Lower division**: Introductory courses — focus on foundational concepts and simple applications.\n",
    "    - **Upper division**: Core major-level courses — assume students understand the basics and introduce more depth and complexity.\n",
    "    - **Graduate**: Advanced courses for Master's or PhD students — cover specialized, research-oriented, or high-complexity topics.\n",
    "\n",
    "    Be thoughtful and accurate in aligning the content with the course level to ensure the generated material is appropriate.\n",
    "    Course Name: {course.name} {course.course_id}\\n\n",
    "    Course Description: {course.description} \\n\n",
    "    Course Level: {course.level}\n",
    "    \"\"\"\n",
    "\n",
    "    completion = client.beta.chat.completions.parse(\n",
    "        model=\"gpt-4o-mini\",\n",
    "        messages=[\n",
    "            {\"role\": \"system\", \"content\": \"Extract the course information\"},\n",
    "            {\n",
    "                \"role\": \"user\",\n",
    "                \"content\": prompt,\n",
    "            },\n",
    "        ],\n",
    "        response_format=AdditionalCourseDescription,\n",
    "    )\n",
    "    \n",
    "    print(f\"Response: {completion.choices[0].message.parsed}\\n \")"
